--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1c3cae70ad8d9641a4b5be915b33736, type: 3}
  m_Name: Bull4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: Heyyyy. You finally summoned me.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: I am the great Genie. Very powerful. Very magical. Very employed.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 139664e598056644193b46fd8e8d34e3, type: 3}
    text: Great Genie?
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5be961f9a5bb06b4d95efb058e8ee00f, type: 3}
    text: Yes. Normally, I can grant you three wishes.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: But my performance review has been really bad lately, so now I can only
      grant one.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c347e233790817342891cf3a95ba10e5, type: 3}
    text: "That is\u2026 not how I thought it works."
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37e91a4387ef267498d82d5f65a8a476, type: 3}
    text: Budget cuts. Stop asking!
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5be961f9a5bb06b4d95efb058e8ee00f, type: 3}
    text: But before I grant your wish, I need you to do something for me.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 787fafedeaa52fc4a96a9263c592c76e, type: 3}
    text: Of course there is a quest.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: I need you to visit my chicken brother.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4de602275831a314da9bbbc701377c83, type: 3}
    text: We have not seen each other for a long time, and I want to know if he is
      doing okay.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: I remember his house is up on the hill. Just go to the right and keep going
      up.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: Also, you can press the lamp anytime to summon me or put me back inside.
  options:
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 86a900989a1394240a11d11c992bd539, type: 3}
    replyText: Sure, I will do it
    nextNode: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    replyText: No. I just want my wish.
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 003006d4304842649ab42a3f9eb29e7b, type: 2}
